andemic  and we were born he went he was bored  i was also voting was bored people still  come up to him today i was like chef  charlie how was your tune  balancing it all is hard work but with  help from their staff and family these  two make it look like a piece of cake  this is like little piece of nostalgia  it sure is there's no tin foil for me to  unwrap yeah there's no battling a  package in this case a classic chocolate  swiss roll and a strawberries and cream  pavlova everything good in all of this  oh yeah totally thank you for joining us  and of course  we brought you this because i looked at  this and i told joe like as long as you  have this  everybody's good this is a like a  step back in time and taste and the  whole place i got to tell you we have an  old fashioned here the drink menu is  incredibly crafted also along with all  the foods that are seasonal you know i  had a harvey hopper which was like a  grasshopper there was a pink squirrel  drink it name it it just was a step back  in time and if you know supper clubs it  really does have that feel and if you  don't you should go because you'll  understand it it's an entire feeling  there's such a sense of nostalgia there  in tradition but this modern twist on it  beautiful i have nothing to say i know  isn't that so good

